# Canonical simulator/XCUITest infrastructure-failure vocabulary.
#
# Single source of truth consumed by:
#   - Scripts/lib/infrastructure-patterns.sh (local retry + CI rerun matcher)
#   - Scripts/failure_diagnostics.py (report classification)
#
# Extended regex, applied case-insensitively; grep -E compatible (no
# lookarounds). Anchored phrases only: broad tokens like "simulator" or
# "scheme" misroute real assertion messages into infrastructure categories.
TRINKET_INFRASTRUCTURE_FAILURE_PATTERN='unable to boot|could not boot|coresimulatorservice|coresimulator (service|error|failure|failed|unavailable)|dtservicehub|launchd_sim|simctl|connection to the service|timed out while launching|failed to launch|background assertion|launch session|no devices are booted|device is not available|device .* unavailable|destination .* not available|no matching destination|destination or simulator service failed|cold boot failed'
